<title>UK: UK's Dunn &amp; Co sold to Ciro Citterio -- KPMG.</title>
<headline>UK's Dunn &amp; Co sold to Ciro Citterio -- KPMG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>British retailer Dunn &amp; Co was sold to menswear firm Ciro Citterio for an undisclosed sum less than a month after it was placed in receivership, receivers from KPMG said on Tuesday. KPMG said all of the upmarket men's clothing store company's stores, warehousing and head offices had been sold, saving nearly 500 jobs.</p>
<p>Dunn &amp; Co, which trades mostly in Wales and the south and west of England, was placed in receivership on December 19.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
